# Atomically commits selected-object attachment under the active reservation.
string token
string operation_id
# Pose of the grasped product's body frame in the gripper's grasp_center frame, as verified by the
# simulated attachment boundary before coupling. World state keeps it so a held product's pose can
# be derived from the robot's kinematics instead of re-observed.
geometry_msgs/Pose grasp_center_from_held_object
---
restocker_interfaces/WorldStateOperationStatus status
# With OK these fields are the current commit/replay receipt. With CLOCK_AUTHORITY_INHIBITED,
# has_reservation=true carries the ORIGINAL historical commit revision/reservation only; it is
# reconciliation evidence and cannot authorize lease release or continuation. False means no
# historical receipt is supplied. ATTACHMENT_CLOCK_NOT_READY never carries a success receipt.
uint64 world_revision
bool has_reservation
restocker_interfaces/TaskReservation reservation
